From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Iscle <albertiscle9@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:39:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] sensors: Combine the front and back ambient light
 sensors

Some devices have a second ambient light sensor on the back, which stock
combines with the front one in its framework: the brighter reading
drives the display brightness. Expose that as a virtual light sensor for
config_displayLightSensorType to select, ignoring the back sensor while a
flash LED is lit and for a second after, and keep both sensors usable on
their own.

Change-Id: Ia06fcdc24e90bb7b0a2e207194fd1c6546f8edd6
